        "text": "Ink the star: from S1 through P2, S2, P3, S3 and on round the star, back to S1. S1 to S8 are its points, and P1 to P8 its inner corners.",
        "paths": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Ink the corner of the large square at K: from X3 through Q1 to X2.",
        "paths": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Ink from X4 through Q2 to X5, at L. Ink from X6 through Q3 to X7, at N. Ink from X8 through Q4 to X1, at J.",
        "paths": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Ink the short lines from S2 to Q1 and from S4 to Q2. Ink the short lines from S6 to Q3 and from S8 to Q4.",
        "paths": 4
      }
    ]
  },
